  "iptv-not-working-common-problems": [
    { heading: "Final Recovery Pattern", body: ["The fastest recovery pattern is simple: identify the layer, change one thing, test again, and record the result. If the app was missing, solve app availability. If credentials failed, solve format and typing. If playback buffered, solve network, device, or stream evidence. If EPG failed, solve guide settings.", "When the service works again, keep the working player, format, and device notes. That small record turns the next problem from a mystery into a repeatable checklist."] },
  ],
